    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Responding without overgeneralising",
     "texto": [
      "A counterexample can limit a broad claim without refuting all its cases. Acknowledge its scope, review quantifiers (\"always\", \"most\") and reformulate a defensible thesis. A reasoned response explains what changes and what stays the same."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
